Runtime dependencies
- three.js, MIT, https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js
- ONNX Runtime Web, MIT, https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
- demucs-web by timcsy, MIT, https://github.com/timcsy/demucs-web

Downloaded at run time, never bundled
- htdemucs_embedded.onnx, from https://huggingface.co/timcsy/demucs-web-onnx
  A conversion of Meta's HT Demucs (MIT code and weights,
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/demucs). The conversion's own repository
  states no licence. It is outside the MIT grant of this project.

Ideas only, with no code taken
- reidbarber/stemplayer and cvd9683-gif/stem-player state no licence.
- lukew3/stemPlayerOnline (Unlicense): the idea of a four-step LED gradient.
- krystalgamer/stem-player-emulator (MIT): facts about the device's file layout.
- The community manual by Gare and the yeezymafia guide: control behaviour and
  the config.txt and TRACK.txt fields.
